207 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 40 0 R
/E (The original dataset is rich in indicators but needs care before analysis because of duplicate rows and uneven missingness. The cleaned dataset makes the country comparisons easier to interpret and reveals clear differences in homicide rates, regional patterns and development indicators. The most important takeaway is not that one variable explains crime, but that country outcomes vary widely and that the observed relationships are complex. The findings are useful as an initial descriptive report, provided the remaining data-quality limitations are kept in view.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
