/Title (The files contain country-level indicators covering population, economic activity, health, education, internet access, environment and homicide. The original workbook has 204 rows and 38 columns. It includes 12 exact duplicate rows, leaving 192 unique country records after deduplication. The cleaned dataset used in the notebook contains 192 countries and 20 selected variables, with no missing values reported in those selected columns.)
