/Title (The cleaned data is more convenient for analysis, but it should not be treated as fully verified. The notebook flags repeated median values in homicide and CO2 emissions, and a duplicated ISO code for Namibia. These issues matter particularly if the dataset is used for mapping, ranking countries or building a predictive model.)
