577 0 obj
<<
/Title (Together, 159 of 192 countries \(82.8%\) fall in the low or moderate categories, with a homicide rate of 10 or below. The maximum recorded rate is 52.0, for El Salvador. The notebook identifies 23 countries above the statistical upper-outlier fence of 14.43. This fence is a method for flagging unusually high values, not a judgement that the records are incorrect.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 551 0 R
/Prev 569 0 R
/Next 570 0 R
>>
endobj
